SUMMARY:Screening of American Graffiti at Costeaux Bakery
DESCRIPTION:Step back into the 1960s with a nostalgic evening beginning at Costeaux French Bakery. Guests are encouraged to dress in their best greaser-inspired style while enjoying a classic diner-style dinner featuring burgers\, fries\, root beer floats\, wine\, and beer. Vintage cars on display add to the retro atmosphere.    After dinner\, the evening continues at True West Film Center with a private screening of American Graffiti\, the iconic coming-of-age film directed by George Lucas and produced with Francis Ford Coppola.    Proceeds benefit Boys &amp; Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin and support youth programs throughout the region.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/private-screening-of-american-graffiti-at-costeaux-french-bakery/
LOCATION:417 Healdsburg Avenue, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.87157;38.612541
CATEGORIES:Beer,Dining,Drink,Film,Food,Food & Wine,Sonoma County
