SUMMARY:Wines &amp; Sunsets at Paradise with Blues Burners
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy Wines &amp; Sunsets\, a seasonal concert series in Paradise featuring live music\, local food vendors\, and sweeping Russian River Valley sunset views. This week’s lineup includes Blues Burners and The Black Piglet\, creating a lively evening of wine country music and community.    Guests can enjoy wines from Paradise Ridge Winery available by the glass or bottle\, paired with rotating onsite food offerings.    Doors open at 5:15 PM\, with food service beginning at 5:30 PM and live music from 6–8 PM. Seating is communal and unreserved\, encouraging a relaxed\, social atmosphere. Outside alcohol is not permitted. Tickets are available for single evenings or as a season pass (non-refundable but transferable).  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/wines-sunsets-at-paradise-with-blues-burners/
LOCATION:4545 Thomas Lake Harris Drive, Santa Rosa, CA, 95403, United States
GEO:-122.7236599;38.4930065
